    summary: "Canonical 今日發布了 Ubuntu 26.04.1 LTS，這是針對「Resolute Raccoon」長期支援版本的第一個點版本更新。此版本整合了自 2024 年 4 月 Ubuntu 26.04 LTS 發布以來，所有累積的錯誤和安全更新（Stable Release Updates, SRUs）。該更新的主要目的是提供更快速、更順暢的安裝體驗，將過去四個月累積的修補程式打包。然而，文章特別指出，Ubuntu 26.04.1 LTS 並不包含任何新的硬體啟用（HWE）堆疊或較新的核心。這類更新預計會在 Ubuntu 26.04.2 LTS 版本，也就是在 Ubuntu 26.10 發布之後提供。建議使用者關注後續的 26.04.2 LTS 版本，以獲取最新的核心和硬體支援。",
    tags: ["Ubuntu", "26.04 LTS", "Canonical", "LTS", "安全更新", "Linux 核心"],
    title_en: "Canonical Releases Ubuntu 26.04.1 LTS, Integrating Four Months of Cumulative Fixes and Security Patches",
    summary_en: "Canonical today released Ubuntu 26.04.1 LTS, the first point release update for the \"Resolute Raccoon\" long-term support version. This version integrates all cumulative bug and security updates (Stable Release Updates, SRUs) since the initial Ubuntu 26.04 LTS release in April 2024. The primary goal of this update is to provide a faster and smoother installation experience by bundling four months of accumulated patches. However, the article specifically notes that Ubuntu 26.04.1 LTS does not include any new Hardware Enablement (HWE) stack or newer kernel. Such updates are expected to be provided in the Ubuntu 26.04.2 LTS version, which will be released after Ubuntu 26.10. Users are advised to monitor the subsequent 26.04.2 LTS version for the latest kernel and hardware support.",
