    title: "Windows 11 26H2 進入預覽階段，預計於九月底或十月初正式發布，強化系統生命週期支援",
    summary: "本文討論 Windows 11 26H2 版本已進入 Release Preview Channel 的測試階段，預計將於九月底或十月初正式發布。作者強調，26H2 並非一次重大的「功能升級」，而是一個旨在重設 Windows 產品生命週期的必要小版本更新。此更新的目的是確保 Windows 11 的支援週期能夠順利延續，因為目前的 Windows 11 25H2 支援將於 2027 年 10 月結束，而 26H2 的支援期將延長至 2028 年。從技術層面來看，26H2 與 25H2 共享核心功能，兩者均基於 24H2 的服務分支，主要差異僅在於建置號碼（Build Number）的更新。對於企業用戶而言，值得關注的變更是 Windows Backup 將預設開啟，此外，26H2 也將「解鎖」多數先前分階段推出的功能，例如檔案總管改進和新的開始選單。雖然 Microsoft 正在準備安裝媒體，但作者建議用戶無需加入 Windows Insider Program，直接使用現有的 Windows 11 25H2 即可，因為兩者功能上差異不大。",
    tags: ["Windows 11", "26H2", "Windows Insider Program", "Microsoft", "系統生命週期", "25H2"],
    title_en: "Windows 11 26H2 Enters Preview Stage, Expected Official Release in Late September or Early October, Strengthening System Lifecycle Support",
    summary_en: "This article discusses that the Windows 11 26H2 version has entered the Release Preview Channel testing phase and is expected to be officially released in late September or early October. The author emphasizes that 26H2 is not a major 'feature upgrade,' but rather a necessary minor version update designed to reset the Windows product lifecycle. The purpose of this update is to ensure the smooth continuation of Windows 11's support cycle, as the current Windows 11 25H2 support ends in October 2027, while 26H2's support period will be extended until 2028. From a technical standpoint, 26H2 shares core functionality with 25H2, as both are based on the 24H2 service branch, with the main difference being the updated Build Number. For enterprise users, notable changes include Windows Backup being enabled by default. Furthermore, 26H2 will 'unlock' many previously phased-in features, such as File Explorer improvements and the new Start Menu. Although Microsoft is preparing installation media, the author advises users not to join the Windows Insider Program, and instead to continue using the existing Windows 11 25H2, as the functional differences between the two are minor.",
